#ASSERT `s 90(1) this section gives a defence on these facts` TRUE TRUE NOTHING TRUE (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 20 1 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b): became aware less than 7 days before the summons (summons 20 January 2026): 14 January is 6 days before; 13 January is 7 days before, which is not less than 7
